  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13981762",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-116269",
      "knowledge_point_id": "96b438f1-77af-551c-8a45-52a93e5995a8",
      "knowledge_point": "Solving Inequalities Requiring Multiplication or Division by a Negative Factor",
      "problem": "Solve the inequality\n\n$$\n\\frac{2x+3}{\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)-\\pi }\\ge \\frac{2-7x}{\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)-\\pi }.\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "Note that the factor $\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)-\\pi $ is always negative. We know this because\n\n$$\n-\\frac{\\pi }{2}<\\operatorname{arctan}⁡x<\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\,⇒\\,-\\frac{3\\pi }{2}<\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)-\\pi <-\\frac{\\pi }{2}.\n$$\n\nSince $\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)-\\pi $ is always negative, we can multiply both sides of the inequality by this quantity, but we have to remember to flip the sign of the inequality. By doing this, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2x+3}{\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)-\\pi } & \\ge \\frac{2-7x}{\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)-\\pi } \\\\ (\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)-\\pi )\\cdot \\frac{2x+3}{\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)-\\pi } & \\le (\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)-\\pi )\\cdot \\frac{2-7x}{\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)-\\pi } \\\\ 2x+3 & \\le 2-7x \\\\ 9x & \\le -1 \\\\ x & \\le -\\frac{1}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices_complete": true,
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "x\\ge -\\frac{1}{3}",
              "option": "0",
              "source_option": "a"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "x\\le -\\frac{1}{9}",
              "option": "1",
              "source_option": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "x\\le -\\frac{2}{3}",
              "option": "2",
              "source_option": "c"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "x\\le \\frac{1}{3}",
              "option": "3",
              "source_option": "d"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "x\\ge \\frac{1}{9}",
              "option": "4",
              "source_option": "e"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
